{"ID":"20240513083056-vwb26z4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083056-vwb26z4","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083056-vwb26z4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513164354-g9ien5d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513164354-g9ien5d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:645,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513164354-g9ien5d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:583,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:583\u0026#125;","title":"248","type":"doc","updated":"20240515115754"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513164354-g9ien5d","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 724px;","id":"20240513164354-g9ien5d","updated":"20240515115754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/05/27"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"195 H, LJ"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"51歲 中等身材"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/05/27"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"C型肝炎、肝硬化。肝有兩公分的血管瘤。慢性胃炎、十二指腸潰瘍。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 全身痛 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 雙腿無力"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→西藥傷腎的結果"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 穿鞋子會覺得緊，不穿足跟會痛。雙腿很緊、時腫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→此乃西藥副作用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 胃口：不餓"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 大便介於棕色跟黑色之間，大便一天一到二次"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 口渴喜溫飲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 小便中黃有泡沫"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. 雙手足尚溫(之前吃西藥是冰的)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9. 睡不好，因身痛(關節痛或頸椎)不適"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙手脈平均，脈一息六至、洪大"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃濕厚"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診 : "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝區最外一圈為痰 肺區有白塊 瞳孔對光反應尚好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 裡溼熱重，肝家陰實一點，腎陽不足，心血也不足"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方： 1.小建中湯"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝四錢  白芍八錢  生畺兩片  炙甘草三錢  大棗十枚"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白朮四錢  炮附子四錢  補骨脂三錢  茯苓五錢  澤瀉五錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃連二錢  黃芩三錢  柴胡三錢  鬱金五錢  龍膽草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"川芎三錢  茜草三錢  炙鱉甲三錢  防風五錢  麻黃三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"杏仁三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10帖  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"→"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各喝一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服時加麥芽糖一匙  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" HT-68養肝丸"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HT-78 健胃散  三餐前二茶匙"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說： \n1."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他有表風，因腿外側緊拖鞋又不適。麻黃杏仁用於開表，他身痛無汗雖無惡寒仍然是麻黃湯證"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":" \n2."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝病及消化道潰瘍："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"若血管破裂吐血且大便黑"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→黃土湯 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"若血管破裂吐血無大便黑"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→柏葉湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}